world  rolling ball into a bucket

floor
  size      6 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

table
  is a      table
  surface   120 by 80 cm
  height    75 cm
  friction  0.7, spinning 0, rolling 0
  colour    wood
  on        floor

table edge
  is a  point
  centred on table.top's far end

bucket
  is an           open box
  length          40 cm
  width           40 cm
  walls           25 cm
  wall thickness  2 cm
  base thickness  2 cm
  friction        0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002
  bounce          dead
  colour          grey
  on floor, 60 cm beyond table edge

ball
  is a      sphere 3 cm radius, 100 g
  rolls
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.7, spinning 0, rolling 0
  colour    orange
  moves     freely
  on table.top, 80 cm behind table edge
  launched  1.6 m/s along
  spins     53.333 rad/s about y

expect
  ball touches table
  ball comes to rest in bucket
